### 5. Collect local folder and apply hosting tracked edits

- **Type:** Branching logic
- **Intent:** Create the local documentation root using a name derived from the
  Drive folder, then author **`.gitignore`**, **`.cursorignore`** (indexing
  force-include), and **`.sedea/documentation-management.yaml`** in the **same**
  hosting **`WORKTREE_ROOT`**.
- **Inputs:** Drive folder **display name** from §4; optional user override for
  local name/path; rclone **`remote`** from §3 (registry may finalize **`remotePath`**
