**Merge act (binding):** On **`approve-merge-pr`**, and only after that same-turn
pick (or Checkpoint happy-path auto-advance that implies merge delegation for
**that** PR), run [rule **6** § *Merge inspect procedure*](.sedea/centers/sedea/rules/6_git-commit-push-gate.mdc)
before mutating GitHub.

1. **Auto-advance** (configuration approval under Checkpoint authorizes full
   promote — **do not** open rule **6** pipeline-depth AskQuestion for
   `commit-only` / `commit-push` / `commit-push-pr`; **do not** open a post-PR
   merge AskQuestion on the happy path): stage named paths for **`.gitignore`**,
